      "title": "Assistant Coach | Track & Field/Cross Country",
      "description": "Posted: 2026-06-04\n\nLocation: Dallas\n\nMisericordia University is seeking a dedicated and knowledgeable part-time Track & Field Throwing Coach to assist with coaching student-athletes in throwing events, including shot put, discus, javelin, and hammer. Responsibilities include planning and leading event-specific training sessions, developing technique and performance, and supporting the overall mission of the athletic program. The ideal candidate will have collegiate playing or coaching experience, strong communication skills, and a commitment to the academic and athletic success of student-athletes. Qualifications: Bachelor’s degree preferred Collegiate playing and/or coaching experience in track & field throwing events preferred Demonstrated technical knowledge of shot put, discus, javelin, and hammer Strong communication and organizational skills Ability to work effectively with student-athletes, coaches, and staff Commitment to NCAA, conference, and university policies and procedures",
